# User pack skills catalog (LLM-only)

**Audience:** model. Constraints only -- procedure: [workflow.mdc](workflow.mdc). Ids/triggers: [SKILL-GRAPH.md](~/.cursor/skills/SKILL-GRAPH.md) -> `skill-graph-seed.wire` (`@SKL` = skill node).

## MUST

- Route by SKILL-GRAPH.md triggers (<=2 passes); do not browse skill directories
- SysML paths: checklist -> workflow -> <=1 `sysml-*` specialist
- After 2 ambiguous scans: ask user or open-repo `AGENTS.md`; optional `reasoning-strategy-selector` only for explicit multi-match
- Model-choice intent -> `llm-model-suggester`
- On add/remove skill: update seed.wire (+ bootstrap `--regenerate-views`)
- Keep `~/.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` count equal to `@SKL` count in seed.wire

## MUST NOT

- Load full skill id lists every turn
- Invent skill ids absent from skill-graph-seed.wire `@SKL`

## MAY

- Open-repo `AGENTS.md` overrides SysML routing; skill bodies stay at `~/.cursor/skills/<id>/`

